personal and like a this is what I had
for lunch and you know there's a great

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:39.970
photo of it and yeah here's me you know
with so-and-so and some people that you

00:05:39.970 --> 00:05:44.220
know it's just they're they're just
better sharing links to articles or

00:05:44.220 --> 00:05:48.490
talking about writing or something yeah
